The GRIB2+CSV files in this directory are meteorological forecast data from the
ICON-CH1-EPS model.

Source:    MeteoSwiss (Federal Office of Meteorology and Climatology)
Dataset:   ch.meteoschweiz.ogd-forecasting-icon-ch1
URL:       https://data.geo.admin.ch/api/stac/v0.9/collections/ch.meteoschweiz.ogd-forecasting-icon-ch1
License:   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: MeteoSwiss, Federal Office of Meteorology and Climatology,
             https://www.meteoswiss.admin.ch
